            "text": "<p>I am Elise Mora. I write a weekly letter for people who run small shops, and I have sent it every Thursday for six years. Before that I wrote newsletters for other people's businesses: bakeries, a bike shop, two potters and a music teacher.</p><p>Every one of them had put it off for months. Not because writing was hard, but because starting meant a dozen decisions at once. The First Issue breaks those decisions into five days.</p>"
